<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Vapi City - The Industrial Capital</h1>
            <p>One of Asia's Largest Industrial Estates</p>
        </header>
        
        <p>
            **Vapi** is a significant industrial town in the Valsad district of Gujarat. Its economy is dominated by the **Vapi Industrial Estate** (V.I.E.), a major center for chemicals, paper, and pharmaceuticals.
        </p>

        <h2>Key City Facts</h2>
        <div class="fact-box">
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Valsad District, Gujarat, India (near the border of Maharashtra).</p>
            <p><strong>Population:</strong> Approx. 165,000 (city area, 2023).</p>
            <p><strong>Known For:</strong> High concentration of **SMEs (Small and Medium Enterprises)** and large-scale chemical and processing industries.</p>
        </div>

        <h2>Major Industrial Sectors</h2>
        <ul class="sector-list">
            <li>
                <strong>Chemical and Dye Industries</strong> (Manufacturing)<br>
                Description: The largest sector, specializing in the production of dyes, pigments, and various organic chemicals.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Paper and Packaging</strong> (Manufacturing)<br>
                Description: Home to several large paper mills and packaging unit factories.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Pharmaceuticals</strong> (Manufacturing)<br>
                Description: A growing sector with units producing APIs (Active Pharmaceutical Ingredients) and formulations.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

